From 896dc154a220ce8cd4af49ac3c3c1874453623ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vladimir Panteleev <git@cy.md>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:42:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(microsoft): calendarView delta sends a series whole, its
 occurrences sparse

As a test tenant shows Graph's delta: any change to a series sends it
whole again, its master and exceptions in full and its occurrences with
only id, type, start, end and seriesMasterId; an occurrence no longer in
the series is left out rather than removed, and a series deleted has its
master alone removed. Changes are recorded by event rather than by
instance to tell what to send. The delta test expected an occurrence's
change alone; it expects the series now.
